gsem is an independent reimplementation in Rust of the algorithms and
public API of GenomicSEM. It links no GenomicSEM code and contains no
copied source, but it is a port of that package's methods and is offered
under the same GPL-3.0 license in keeping with the original work.

GenomicSEM is the canonical reference implementation and the academic
citation target. If you use this software, please cite the original
paper:

    Grotzinger, A. D., Rhemtulla, M., de Vlaming, R., Ritchie, S. J.,
    Mallard, T. T., Hill, W. D., Ip, H. F., Marioni, R. E.,
    McIntosh, A. M., Deary, I. J., Koellinger, P. D., Harden, K. P.,
    Nivard, M. G., & Tucker-Drob, E. M. (2019). Genomic structural
    equation modelling provides insights into the multivariate genetic
    architecture of complex traits. Nature Human Behaviour, 3(5),
    513-525. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41562-019-0566-x
